@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### Platform stats
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stats

### All fields (IT is active, the rest are "coming soon")
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/fields

### IT field with its sub-field cards
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/fields/it

### Sub-field page: description, reality check, roadmap, communities
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/subfields/game-development

### People on a path
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/subfields/game-development/people

### Discussion topics of a path
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/subfields/game-development/topics

### Latest topics across all paths
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/topics/recent?take=4

### People directory with filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users?path=game-development&openOnly=true

### Log in as the demo student (all demo accounts use the password demo1234)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@careerpath.dev",
  "password": "demo1234"
}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### Current user
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Suggested collaborators for the current user
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/suggestions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Collaboration inbox (incoming and outgoing)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/collaborations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Mark roadmap step 3 as done
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/progress/3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Start a discussion topic
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/subfields/game-development/topics
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Which game jam is best for a first-timer?",
  "body": "I want to join my first jam next month. Any beginner-friendly ones?",
  "kind": "Question"
}
